  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Employment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed new PDO is: to assist targeted vulnerable urban populations in the Recipient&#x2019;s territory to (i) increase their incomesthrough the provision of short term employment; (ii) improve their knowledge, experience and basic employment skills that are valued in the workplace and society; and (iii) improve their access to services and markets through repaired, more climate resilient roads and access infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
